          <p>A design sprint run as part of the discovery program for the RAA Travel platform — bringing together product managers, travel agents, marketing, and engineering to map the end-to-end customer journey and identify the highest-impact opportunities for the redesigned booking experience.</p>
          <p>The sprint began with in-person customer interviews conducted in RAA stores alongside the product manager. The team then mapped the full customer journey on a whiteboard from awareness through booking and post-travel, with back-stage constraints from travel operations visible alongside the front-stage customer experience. The sprint outputs shaped the design direction for the Travel platform rebuild that followed.</p>
