          <p>Figma files show the breadth of product coverage — identity management and authentication flows, payment and renewals screens, claims submission, and the My Account portal. Each file is structured for engineering handover with component references, accessibility annotations, and edge case documentation.</p>
          <p>All screens built against the RAA design system — a component library governing web and mobile UI across the full product suite. Contributed to the design system from its foundation, building components, documentation, and governance before the system existed in its current form.</p>
